00:00:15.971 --> 00:00:18.920
- For our season finale,
the food above all food.

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:20.686
- Or that you eat at
the end of others foods.

00:00:20.686 --> 00:00:21.519
- And that is

00:00:21.519 --> 00:00:22.352
cake.
- Mints.

00:00:22.352 --> 00:00:23.185
- What?

00:00:23.185 --> 00:00:24.786
- Mints.

00:00:24.786 --> 00:00:25.661
No, it's cake.

00:00:25.661 --> 00:00:27.579
- We are going to eat
three cakes in three days

00:00:27.579 --> 00:00:29.946
at three drastically
different price points

00:00:29.946 --> 00:00:31.760
to find out which one is the most worth it

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:33.188
