00:00:33.188 --> 00:00:34.834
I love cake.

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:37.761
Cake represents celebration,
it represents happiness.

00:00:37.761 --> 00:00:40.278
It's a symbol of joy and coming together.

00:00:40.278 --> 00:00:42.106
- I'm not crazy about cake, honestly.

00:00:42.106 --> 00:00:45.897
I think most cake, it's just
too sweet, it's one note.

00:00:45.897 --> 00:00:48.841
