00:00:58.718 --> 00:01:01.635
(slow indie music)

00:01:06.836 --> 00:01:08.591
- My name is Betty
Porto, one of the owners

00:01:08.591 --> 00:01:10.486
of Porto's Bakery and Cafe.

00:01:10.486 --> 00:01:11.319
My sister,

00:01:11.319 --> 00:01:12.152
- Margarita.

00:01:12.152 --> 00:01:12.988
- And we work together.

00:01:12.988 --> 00:01:14.117
Porto's was started by my mother.

00:01:14.117 --> 00:01:15.548
We came from Cuba as immigrants.

00:01:15.548 --> 00:01:17.867
Started making cakes at
home and selling them

00:01:17.867 --> 00:01:20.118
to the neighbors for
whatever they could give her.

00:01:20.118 --> 00:01:21.913
People would bring other
people, telling each other

00:01:21.913 --> 00:01:23.568
