00:01:38.068 --> 00:01:40.447
- It's a tres leches, so we
take the tres leches sponge,

00:01:40.447 --> 00:01:43.394
which is a sponge that's
soaked in a milk syrup,

00:01:43.394 --> 00:01:46.599
