00:02:15.789 --> 00:02:17.873
the famous Milk 'n Berries cake.

00:02:17.873 --> 00:02:20.435
It is a tres leches cake

00:02:20.435 --> 00:02:21.410
- Stuffed with berries.

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:22.243
- It's a beautiful thing.

00:02:22.243 --> 00:02:23.941
I think first, we take a sip of the

00:02:23.941 --> 00:02:24.774
