00:02:24.774 --> 00:02:27.513
- Two shots of espresso with
condensed milk and milk in it.

00:02:27.513 --> 00:02:31.334
And this heart represents the
love that I have for Adam.

00:02:31.334 --> 00:02:32.704
Cheers.

00:02:32.704 --> 00:02:34.737
(upbeat acoustic music)

00:02:34.737 --> 00:02:36.082
